{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261101/photo/bkn-20261101035219924-1101_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261101075538\"/><p>今日(11月1日)凌晨0時55分，上環醫院道18號一名14歲男童家人報案，指男童曾被其35歲父親不恰當對待。警員接報到場，經初步調查，懷疑涉事父親曾以手襲擊兒子，他涉嫌「對所看管兒童或少年人虐待或忽略」被捕，現正被扣留調查。男童眼、手、額頭受傷，清醒被送往瑪麗醫院治理。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-01T03:38:08.130131+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":143,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-31T19:52:19+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-01T04:18:18.511638+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-01T03:31:09.618810+00:00","content_hash":"34245c689fc524374bf054a6333d84430de6258a2d8d27d4b000b33bc39e1953","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}